The archive includes a PDFium dynamic library from bblanchon/pdfium-binaries, pinned to
`chromium/8009`. PDFium is distributed under a BSD-style license and incorporates other
third-party components. The complete license set shipped by that exact upstream archive is copied
unchanged into `licenses/pdfium/` in each mimus archive.

Sources:

- https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries/tree/chromium/8009
- https://pdfium.googlesource.com/pdfium/

