## Rust dependencies

The executable statically incorporates Rust libraries under their package-declared licenses. The
archive's generated `RUST_DEPENDENCIES.txt` is the exact normal-dependency inventory for the locked
build, including `ort`, `pdfium-render`, `lopdf`, `reqwest`, `redb`, `skrifa`, `subsetter`, and
`ttf-parser`. Corresponding license texts are distributed in each crate's source package from
crates.io; source URLs and SPDX expressions are preserved in the inventory.
